nhanced transport: σ=1.5 S/m, t⁺=0.45 |\n| Separator | PE, 12 µm, porosity 50% | Shutdown temperature ~130°C |\n| Positive CC | Al, 16 µm | Standard |\n| Negative CC | Cu, 12 µm | Standard |\n"}
